    "The specific cause of the correctness failure (e.g., type mismatch, null handling) is not identified in the evidence.",
    "No performance metrics or latency measurements are provided to validate the optimization's effectiveness.",
    "The plan does not address potential type mismatches between SQLite JSON output and Pydantic models.",
    "Test cases triggering the failure are not described."
